"requests queue for the four CPUs, and the p99 there is the scheduler's "
"tail rather than the cost of one request. An open-loop generator, which "
"sends at a fixed rate and times each request from its intended send, "
"measures latency at equal offered load instead. For admitted requests in "
"reverse-proxy mode, the p99 is 65 us at 10,000 requests per second and "
